│────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────│
││ Title: > Task title...                                                      Actions                               │
││ Description:                                                                ──────────────────────────────────────│
││ ┃   1 Task description (optional)...                                         Tab / Shift+Tab Switch fields        │
││ ┃                                                                            Ctrl+C Clear focused field           │
││ ┃                                                                            T/B/F/E/C Set type                   │
││ ┃                                                                            0/1/2/3/4 Set priority               │
││ ┃                                                                            h/l or ←/→ Cycle impl combinations   │
││ ┃                                                                            Ctrl+P Paste image                   │
││ ┃                                                                            j/k + d Manage attachments           │
││ ┃                                                                            Enter Create Task                    │
││ ┃                                                                            Ctrl+E Edit in $EDITOR               │
││ Type: [●T] [ B] [ F] [ E] [ C]                                               Ctrl+K Clear form                    │
││ Priority: [ 0] [ 1] [●2] [ 3] [ 4]                                           Esc Cancel                           │
││ Impls: [<] (none) [>]                                                                                             │
││ Acceptance Criteria:                                                                                              │
││ ┃   1 Acceptance criteria (optional)...                                                                           │
